    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
  - cn: "\u90A3\u4E9B\u4EBA\u6CA1\u51E0\u4E2A\u813E\u6C14\u597D\u7684\uFF0C\u4F46\u6D1B\u5C14\u574E\u813E\u6C14\u597D\u7684\u786E\u5B9E\u6709\u4E9B\u8FC7\u5934\u4E86\u3002"
    en: Very few people in that line of work have good tempers, but Lorquin's temper
      is almost too good.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
